          deckDescription: 'One standard 52-card deck consisting of four suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs), each with thirteen ranks from ace down to two. No jokers; used for Bartok (or similar shedding game) where players match by suit or rank and follow house rules.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs). Players must match the previous card by suit or rank; special cards may reverse, skip, or change suit. First to empty hand wins.',
